      "description": "Run the full supervised CodeHawk pipeline for one jurisdiction. Registry/cache first, then official-source discovery, direct retrieval, tiered cost-capped Scrapfly, cited extraction, QC, and gated writes. Args: { jurisdiction, state, force_refresh?, dry_run? }."
    },
    {
      "function_name": "codehawkBatch",
